			["say", "Sara", ["Every resident's heartbeat. Rusk's is the slow one. Pip's goes fast when he dreams.",
				"[happy] Yours is the one by my left hand."], "S.A.R.A."],
			["say", "", ["Somewhere below, the corridor lights dim, one deck at a time. A low hum fills the core."]],
